---
servings: 4
---

Preheat oven to 200 degrees Celsius.

Soak @wholewheat bread{1%slice} in hot @chicken stock{1/3%cup}.

Mix with @ostrich mince{500%g}, finely choped @onion{1}, crushed @garlic{2%cloves}, @egg{1}, @salt{}, @black pepper{} and @olive oil{2%tsp}.

Mix well with hands and refridgerate for 30 minutes.

Use a 1/8 cup measuring cup to scoop and for meatballs and place on tray.

Cook in oven for 30 minutes.

Garnish with @parsley{1/2%punnet}.
